<resources>
    <string name="f050_title">模糊匹配容错</string>
    <string name="f050_desc">错字、简繁、空格差异不该让结果消失：先把查询和标题归一化，再按容错级别给出近似结果，并说清为什么命中</string>

    <string name="f050_section_search">查询</string>
    <string name="f050_search_hint">输入要搜的片名</string>
    <string name="f050_search_action">匹配</string>
    <string name="f050_demo_action">演示：luse hai yang → 蓝色海洋</string>
    <string name="f050_search_body_hint">输入后回车或点「匹配」，下面 8 条演示标题会按命中分从高到低排；空格、标点、全角字符在比较前都会被丢掉</string>
    <string name="f050_blank_query">先输入要搜的内容再点匹配</string>
    <string name="f050_toast_searched">已按「%1\$s」匹配</string>
    <string name="f050_toast_row">%1\$s · %2\$s · 编辑距离 %3\$d</string>

    <string name="f050_section_tolerance">容错级别</string>
    <string name="f050_tolerance_0">0 级 · 精确</string>
    <string name="f050_tolerance_1">1 级 · 容 1 字</string>
    <string name="f050_tolerance_2">2 级 · 容 2 字</string>
    <string name="f050_tolerance_hint">级别就是允许的编辑距离上限，只作用在「错字近似」和「拼音近似」两步；完全一致、前缀、包含、拼音一致这几步不受级别影响</string>
    <string name="f050_normalize_idle">归一化结果：（还没有查询）</string>
    <string name="f050_normalize_stat">归一化结果：%1\$s</string>

